    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game has a high level of difficulty and is suitable for people who enjoy using their brains and challenges. Come and test your intelligence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >this is a 3D cartoon style tower defense game with many levels. At the beginning of each level, a small amount of resources are given, and more resources can be obtained by killing monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The health and movement speed of each monster in the game are different. When they have an energy shield, their health will increase</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pumpkin turrets deal higher damage to shields, while other turrets deal lower damage to shields</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is an explosive magic in the game that can deal damage to a group of monsters, with damage to high health monsters being percentage damage</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 upgradable defense turrets</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 magic</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill tree that can be used to upgrade turrets and magic</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >16 types of monsters (8 ordinary monsters+8 ordinary monsters with shields)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >25 levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616320/extras/171b86e6d1b96d22737cd44665c8f868.poster.avif?t=1750566506\" width=600 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616320/extras/171b86e6d1b96d22737cd44665c8f868.webm?t=1750566506\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616320/extras/171b86e6d1b96d22737cd44665c8f868.mp4?t=1750566506\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game has a high level of difficulty and is suitable for people who enjoy using their brains and challenges. Come and test your intelligence.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >this is a 3D cartoon style tower defense game with many levels. At the beginning of each level, a small amount of resources are given, and more resources can be obtained by killing monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The health and movement speed of each monster in the game are different. When they have an energy shield, their health will increase</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pumpkin turrets deal higher damage to shields, while other turrets deal lower damage to shields</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is an explosive magic in the game that can deal damage to a group of monsters, with damage to high health monsters being percentage damage</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 upgradable defense turrets</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 magic</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill tree that can be used to upgrade turrets and magic</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >16 types of monsters (8 ordinary monsters+8 ordinary monsters with shields)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >25 levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616320/extras/171b86e6d1b96d22737cd44665c8f868.poster.avif?t=1750566506\" width=600 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616320/extras/171b86e6d1b96d22737cd44665c8f868.webm?t=1750566506\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3616320/extras/171b86e6d1b96d22737cd44665c8f868.mp4?t=1750566506\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
